/Battle_of_the_Lerna_Mills"}],"do":[{"name":"Palamidi fortress","type":"activity","detail":"The Venetian fortress on the 216 m hill over the town, eight linked bastions. The stairway up from the Arvanitia side takes 30 to 45 minutes at a steady pace; there is also a road to the east gate.","evidence":{"n_sources":9,"of":13,"urls":["https://cityofnafplio.net/en/sights/palamidi","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece-guide/","https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"The old town on foot","type":"activity","detail":"Greece's first capital, and traffic free: marble lanes, Venetian and neoclassical facades, and Syntagma square at the centre of it.","evidence":{"n_sources":8,"of":13,"urls":["https://greeking.me/blog/greek-mainland/things-to-do-in-nafplio","https://wanderingwagars.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio/","https://waylesstravelers.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Bourtzi","type":"activity","detail":"A Venetian fort filling its own islet in the harbour mouth, reached by the small boats that run from the quay.","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g319780-Activities-Nafplio_Argolis_Region_Peloponnese.html","https://www.itsalltriptome.com/what-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece-guide/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Arvanitia to Karathona coastal path","type":"trail","detail":"About 3 km of flat waymarked path cut into the rock under the Palamidi cliffs, from the town beach round to the sandy one. Roughly 45 minutes.","season":[3,4,5,6,9,10,11],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://theplanetgreece.com/hiking-in-nafplio/","https://vida-hospitality.com/walking/","https://nafplio.app/best-beaches"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Swim at Karathona","type":"swim","detail":"The long sandy bay 3 km from town, shallow and sheltered. Arvanitia, right under the old town, is gravel and quicker to reach.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.visitnafplio.com/beaches.html","https://nafplio.app/best-beaches","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece-guide/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Theatre of Epidaurus","type":"activity","detail":"A 4th century BC theatre half an hour away, the best preserved in Greece and still famous for carrying a whisper to the back row.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece","https://greeking.me/blog/greek-mainland/things-to-do-in-nafplio","https://www.itsalltriptome.com/what-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Archaeological Museum","type":"activity","detail":"In a Venetian warehouse on the main square, and worth it for one thing above all: a complete bronze suit of armour from nearby Mycenae.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece","https://travelthegreekway.com/best-things-to-do-in-nafplion-greece/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g319780-Activities-Nafplio_Argolis_Region_Peloponnese.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Nemea wine tasting","type":"experience","detail":"The Agiorgitiko heartland is an easy drive north, and the wineries take visitors.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":13,"urls":["https://wanderingwagars.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio/","https://travelthegreekway.com/best-things-to-do-in-nafplion-greece/","https://waylesstravelers.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Midea","type":"activity","detail":"10 km away","sources":["commons","wikidata","wikipedia"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":3,"sources":["commons","wikidata","wikipedia"]}},{"name":"Dendra","type":"activity","deta